// CreaturesOpponentControls = "each creature an opponent controls" — the
// symmetric-anthem counterpart to `OtherCreaturesYouControl` (a debuff over
// the opposing team rather than a boost over your own). A Selection-kind
// macro: the whole `SelectAll(...)` IS the macro body, so a card spells it as
// `Each(CreaturesOpponentControls, Modify(It, <change>))` directly. Nests the
// reusable `CreatureOpponentControls` Predicate atom rather than repeating
// its `And([...])` filter inline.
(
    name: "CreaturesOpponentControls",
    template: "each creature an opponent controls",
    kinds: [Selection],
    body: SelectAll(CreatureOpponentControls),
)
